TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
LOCATION:Anderson 121
DESCRIPTION:Pre Health advisor Pam Middleton will provide information on p
 reparing for medical school and other health professions schools. This ses
 sion is geared towards first-year students\; however any student who has r
 ecently decided to consider medicine as a career should plan to attend.\n<
 div class="value">\n\nNote: The sessions on the 23rd and 24th of September
  are the same\; you only need to attend one of them.\n\n</div>\n\nView thi
 s event on the Carleton College website:\nhttps://www.carleton.edu/_c/uuge
ORGANIZER;CN="Pre-Health Program":mailto:vlcahrll41c7ubti5idp9lesko@group.
 calendar.google.com
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260916T170758
END:VEVENT
