SUMMARY:Investment Banking Analyst Recruiting at Perella Weinberg
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
LOCATION:For more information or to register\, see <a href="https://carlet
 on.joinhandshake.com/events/1983745/share_preview/">Handshake</a>
DESCRIPTION:<img class="" src="https://cdn.carleton.edu/uploads/sites/676/
 2026/08/Perella.png" alt="Perella Logo" width="265" height="131" data-name
 ="image" />\n\n<strong>Ready to launch your career on Wall Street?</strong
 >\n\nJoin Carleton alum <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/tristandresb
 ach/"><strong>Tristan Dresbach ’17</strong></a> for an inside look at 
 <a href="https://pwpartners.com/"><strong>Perella Weinberg Partners (PWP)<
 /strong></a>—one of the premier independent investment banking firms in 
 the world.\n\nWhether you're aiming for a <strong>2028 Global Summer Anal
 yst</strong> position (opening October 2026 for the Class of 2029) or loo
 king to jumpstart your skills through the <strong>2027 Global Prep Progra
 m</strong>\, this is your fast track to breaking into investment banking.\
 n\n<strong>What you’ll get out of it:</strong>\n<ul>\n 	<li>Direct netwo
 rking with a PWP banker and a Carleton alumnus</li>\n 	<li>A crash course 
 in banking fundamentals and day-to-day analyst life</li>\n 	<li>The ultima
 te insider breakdown on hiring timelines\, expectations\, and how to make 
 your application stand out</li>\n</ul>\nDon't miss out on getting a head s
 tart on your recruiting journey!\n\nView this event on the Carleton Colleg
 e website:\nhttps://www.carleton.edu/_c/ut1m
ORGANIZER;CN="Career Center Events":mailto:e6n22m53s4lq205dsr03tqqlf4@grou
 p.calendar.google.com
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260803T155006
END:VEVENT
