SUMMARY:Taizé Evensong: Contemplative Christian Song &amp\; Prayer
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
LOCATION:Chapel
DESCRIPTION:Join us for our weekly contemplative Christian vespers service
  with music\, readings &amp\; meditative silence. Holy Communion is offere
 d on \neven numbered weeks of Fall Term. The service is led in the style o
 f the Taizé community and has been offered at Carleton for over 30 years.
  \n\nTaizé Evensong is led by Chaplains' Associates\, and other students.
  Hot chocolate &amp\; tea are served after the service. Please don't hesit
 ate to be in touch with any questions or to get involved. All are welcome 
 - we hope to see you soon!\n\nView this event on the Carleton College webs
 ite:\nhttps://www.carleton.edu/_c/roPp
ORGANIZER;CN="Chaplain's Office":mailto:gc0r4cojm5g3aensafau0dppd8@group.c
 alendar.google.com
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260713T212158
