 7/"><img src="https://cdn.carleton.edu/uploads/sites/676/2026/08/ArtisanPa
 rtners.png" alt="Artisan Partners Logo" data-name="image" /></a>\n\n<a hre
 f="https://www.linkedin.com/in/graeme-harten-cfa-bab87157/">Graeme Harten 
 ’15</a>\, CFA\, is a lead analyst on the <a href="https://www.artisanpa
 rtners.com/">Artisan Partners</a> Developing World Team. In this role\, h
 e conducts fundamental research and invests in emerging markets stocks\, w
 ith a particular focus on Asia\, Eastern Europe\, and the Middle East.\n\n
 Prior to joining Artisan Partners\, Graeme worked in institutional equity 
 sales at <a href="https://en.cicc.com/">China International Capital Corpo
 ration Limited (CICC)</a>.\n\nGraeme was a double major in economics and A
 sian studies and played on the men’s golf team at Carleton College.\n\nS
 ign up to meet with Graeme to have him review your resume\, talk about his
