DESCRIPTION:Join us for the Opening Reception for <em><a href="https://www
 .carleton.edu/museum/exhibitions/field-notes/">Field Notes: Studio Art Fac
 ulty Respond to the Arboretum’s Centennial Year</a>.</em>\n\nThis exhibi
 tion presents new work by Carleton studio art faculty in response to the C
 arleton College Cowling Arboretum’s landscapes\, histories\, and ecologi
 cal significance. It marks the 100th anniversary of the Arboretum\, an 800
 -acre living laboratory of prairie\, forest\, and river habitats that has 
 shaped teaching\, research\, and life on campus since the 1920s.\n\nThe ac
 companying events program will include talks by participating studio art f
 aculty\, offering insight into their creative processes.\n\nEvent Details:
