 reers
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
LOCATION:<a href="https://www.carleton.edu/map/willis/">Willis 203</a>\; F
 or more information or to register\, see <a href="https://carleton.joinhan
 dshake.com/edu/events/2013439/share_preview/">Handshake</a>
DESCRIPTION:<img class="" src="https://cdn.carleton.edu/uploads/sites/676/
 2026/09/JPMorgan.png" alt="J.P.Morgan Private Bank Logo" width="192" heigh
 t="71" data-name="image" />\n<p data-path-to-node="1">Ever wondered what i
 t actually takes to break into high-net-worth wealth management? Curious h
 ow a liberal arts background translates into a high-impact finance career?
 </p>\n<p data-path-to-node="2">Join Carleton alumnus <a href="https://www.
 linkedin.com/in/andrew-ulland-cfa-3b9540/">Andrew Ulland ’99</a> and a p
 anel of sharp analysts from <a href="https://privatebank.jpmorgan.com/nam/
 en/home">J.P. Morgan Private Bank’s</a> Minneapolis office for an exclus
 ive\, insider look at the industry. Whether you're actively preparing for 
 the upcoming recruiting cycle or just exploring your options in the financ
 ial services space\, this is your direct pipeline to actionable advice and
  key industry connections.</p>\n<strong>Featured Speakers</strong>\n<ul>\n
  	<li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/andrew-ulland-cfa-3b9540/" targ
 et="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Andrew Ulland ’99</a>\, Vice Presi
 dent</li>\n 	<li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/cooper-long-4b966625
 3/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Cooper J. Long ’26</a>\, A
 nalyst</li>\n 	<li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/olivia-moore-a756b
 11a2/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Olivia Moore</a>\, Analys
 t</li>\n 	<li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/brody-hardacre-787b7724
 b/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Brody Hardacre</a>\, Analyst
 </li>\n</ul>\nThis session covers the private banking industry and career 
 pathways post-Carleton\, followed by J.P. Morgan recruiting details and a 
 dedicated 30-minute Q&amp\;A.\n\nDon't leave your recruiting strategy to c
 hance—come build your network with the leaders who have walked in your s
 hoes.\n\nView this event on the Carleton College website:\nhttps://www.car
 leton.edu/_c/uuf2
ORGANIZER;CN="Career Center Events":mailto:e6n22m53s4lq205dsr03tqqlf4@grou
 p.calendar.google.com
