SUMMARY:Foods of Faith
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
LOCATION:Multicultural Center
DESCRIPTION:Join us in preparing and eating religiously and culturally sig
 nificant foods. Drop in anytime\, 1-3pm: Saturdays of weeks 2\,4\,6\,8 in 
 the Multicultural Center\n\nOur goal is to provide new cultural experience
 s through food. If you have any questions or any suggestions on what we sh
 ould make next\, don’t hesitate to reach out to us.\n\n-Issac\, James\, 
 Nina\, Madeleine\n\nOn September 26th\, we will be making apple crisp\, a 
 desert with apples and honey emblematic of the Jewish High Holidays season
  and hope for a sweet new year.\n\nView this event on the Carleton College
  website:\nhttps://www.carleton.edu/_c/roVW
