SUMMARY:Law School Admissions 101 (University of Michigan)
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
LOCATION:<a href="https://www.carleton.edu/map/agh/">Alumni Guest House Me
 eting Room</a>\; For more information or to register\, see <a href="https:
 //carleton.joinhandshake.com/events/1992524/share_preview/">Handshake</a>
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://michigan.law.umich.edu/"><img src="https://d3
 1kydh6n6r5j5.cloudfront.net/uploads/sites/676/2022/08/MichiganLaw.png" alt
 ="Michigan Law School Logo" data-name="image" /></a>\n\n<strong>Thinking A
 bout Law School? Get the Inside Scoop from Michigan Law’s "Dean Z"</stro
 ng>\n\nWhether you’re actively applying or just law-school-curious\, joi
 n <strong>Sarah Zearfoss P'16 ("Dean Z")</strong>\, Senior Assistant Dean
  at the University of Michigan Law School\, for an insider’s guide to na
 vigating the admissions process.\n\nWith over 25 years of experience readi
 ng 100\,000+ applications\, Dean Z knows exactly what makes an application
  stand out—and what gets it set aside. From the LSAT and personal essays
  to resumes\, addenda\, and letters of recommendation\, she’ll break dow
 n what <i>actually</i> works in competitive law school admissions.\n<ul>\
 n 	<li><strong>Bonus:</strong> Having also led Michigan Law’s Financial
  Aid\, Career Planning\, and Student Life teams\, Dean Z can answer virtua
 lly <i>any</i> question you have about the law school experience!</li>\n
 </ul>\n<strong>Free lunch provided!</strong> (Please register in advance 
 so we have an accurate head count)\n\n<strong>Extra Opportunity:</strong>
  Sign up for a <a href="https://www.carleton.edu/career/connect/news-eve
 nts/events/?eId=ut3r"><strong>1:1 meeting</strong></a> with Dean Z immedi
 ately following the session.\n\nView this event on the Carleton College we
 bsite:\nhttps://www.carleton.edu/_c/ut3x
ORGANIZER;CN="Career Center Events":mailto:e6n22m53s4lq205dsr03tqqlf4@grou
 p.calendar.google.com
