TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
LOCATION:Multiculturak House
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an afternoon of cooking and conversation with Mar
 ía\, our guest chef from Colombia! Enjoy delicious homemade food while pr
 acticing Spanish. All language levels are welcome. Capacity limited to 12 
 people. In collaboration with the Northfield Public Library and sponsored 
