 field methods\, live immersed in a landscape\, and cultivate a deep and ba
 lanced understanding of conservation all while earning academic credit.</s
 pan> <a href="https://roundriver.org/study-abroad/">https://drive.google.c
 om/file/d/1Ds89WbBT0HCuteOFjRoE-jM-Z9TdZQ2x/view?usp=sharing</a>\n\nEvent 
