 iles Travel Fellowship in 2024-2025. Come hear about their travels to an A
 ustrian nunnery (Jennifer Bricker '27)\, a restored castle in France (Caro
 line Berkey '28)\, and the Musée de Cluny in Paris (Noelle Paek '28) and 
 how this fellowship may be right for you!\n\nPizza (and other nice lunch f
 oods) will be served!\n\nView this event on the Carleton College website:\
 nhttps://www.carleton.edu/_c/ut44
