 eligious Spaces.\n\nFood from Northfield Thai provided (limited). No regis
 tration required.\n\nThe Queer Mental Health Collective at Carleton Colleg
 e is a safe space for LGBTQIA+ students to form community through conversa
 tion and actively supporting one another’s mental health and wellbeing. 
