LOCATION:Hennepin Partners\, <a href="https://share.google/rC6gdmmfsQT8UVG
 uk">650 3rd Ave S\, Suite 1500\, Minneapolis\, MN 55402</a>\; To register\
 , see <a href="https://carleton.joinhandshake.com/events/1997525/share_pre
 view">Handshake</a>
DESCRIPTION:<strong>Hennepin Partners</strong> is co-hosting a <i>Women 
 in M&amp\;A: Exploring Career Paths Across Deal-Making Industries</i> eve
 nt at their Minneapolis office with professionals from several firms\, inc
 luding: Carlson Private Capital Partners\, Yukon Partners\, Taft\, and Fre
 drikson.\n\n<strong>Attendees will have the opportunity to:</strong>\n<ul>
 \n 	<li>Participate in small-group discussions with women working across M
 &amp\;A-related careers</li>\n 	<li>Learn about career paths in investment
  banking\, private equity\, venture capital\, debt financing\, and transac
 tional law</li>\n 	<li>Network with professionals and fellow students</li>
 \n</ul>\nThe goal is to provide students with direct access to professiona
 ls who can offer insights into the day-to-day realities of these industrie
 s\, discuss career paths\, and answer questions about recruiting and profe
 ssional development.\n\nNote: We are specifically targeting women students
  for this event.\n\nView this event on the Carleton College website:\nhttp
 s://www.carleton.edu/_c/ut6O
