LOCATION:Career Center\, Johnson House\; For more information or to regist
 er\, see <a href="https://carleton.joinhandshake.com/edu/events/1980313">H
 andshake</a>
DESCRIPTION:Are you applying for an externship\, internship\, or job? Rece
 ive one-on-one guidance and feedback on your resume or cover letter from a
  student career assistant (SCA) or a professional career coach at Resume R
 eview Rush. Drop in for a quick\, 15-minute review anytime during the even
 t\, and we'll guide you through formatting\, structure\, and highlighting 
 your experiences and skills.\n\nBring a printed copy of your document. Thi
 s is a great opportunity to get your resume approved as "Success Ready" be
 fore the upcoming applied externships deadline of Oct. 4. All are welcome!
 \n\nView this event on the Carleton College website:\nhttps://www.carleton
 .edu/_c/ut3S
