SUMMARY:Graduate &amp\; Summer Research Opportunities with UMN Medical Sch
 ool - Tabling at Sayles
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
LOCATION:<a href="https://apps.carleton.edu/map/sayles/">Sayles Tables</a>
DESCRIPTION:<p data-path-to-node="6"><a href="https://med.umn.edu/gps"><im
 g class="" src="https://cdn.carleton.edu/uploads/sites/676/2026/08/images-
 2.png" alt="UMN Medical School Graduate Programs and Summer Undergrad Rese
 arch" width="194" height="158" data-name="image" /></a></p>\n<strong>Inter
 ested in biomedical research\, a PhD\, or an MD/PhD path after Carleton?</
 strong>\n\n<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ryan-mata/"><strong>Ryan M
 ata\, Ph.D.</strong></a>\, Program Manager<strong> </strong>from the <a 
 href="https://med.umn.edu/gps"><strong>University of Minnesota Medical Sch
 ool\,</strong></a> will be visiting campus to talk about fully funded gra
 duate programs and paid summer research opportunities!\n\n<strong>What UMN
  Medical School Offers:</strong>\n<ul>\n 	<li><a href="https://med.umn.edu
 /gps/graduate-studies"><strong>11 Graduate Programs</strong></a> spanning
  top fields including Neuroscience\, Immunology\, Cancer Biology\, Pharmac
 ology\, Genetics\, and Stem Cell Biology.</li>\n 	<li><a href="https://med
 .umn.edu/gps/graduate-studies/tuition-funding"><strong>Full Financial Supp
 ort</strong></a><strong>:</strong> Doctoral programs include full tuition
 \, fees\, and competitive annual stipends.</li>\n 	<li><strong>Flexible De
 gree Options:</strong> PhD\, Master’s (MS)\, and joint <strong>MD/PhD 
 (MSTP)</strong> pathways.</li>\n 	<li><a href="https://med.umn.edu/gps/un
 dergraduate-research/life-sciences-summer"><strong>Life Sciences Summer Un
 dergraduate Research Program (LSSURP)</strong></a><strong>:</strong> A pa
 id 10-week summer research experience on the Twin Cities campus complete w
 ith housing\, food plans\, and hands-on lab experience.</li>\n</ul>\nWheth
 er you are seeking 2027 graduate admissions or a 2027 summer research inte
 rnship\, stop by to learn how your Carleton education prepares you for wor
 ld-class research.\n\nView this event on the Carleton College website:\nht
 tps://www.carleton.edu/_c/ut3d
ORGANIZER;CN="Career Center Events":mailto:e6n22m53s4lq205dsr03tqqlf4@grou
 p.calendar.google.com
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260812T214827
END:VEVENT
