 g><u>Date</u></strong><u></u><b></b>\nTuesday\, October 6\, 2026\n\n<stron
 g><u>Time\n</u></strong><u></u><b></b>12:00-2:00 p.m.\n\n<strong><u>Locati
 on\n</u></strong>Presidio Golf &amp\; Concordia Club\n8 Presidio Terrace\n
