 For more information or to register\, see <a href="https://carleton.joinha
 ndshake.com/events/2002563/share_preview/">Handshake</a>
DESCRIPTION:<img class="" src="https://cdn.carleton.edu/uploads/sites/676/
 2025/10/Jesuit.jpg" alt="Jesuit Volunteer Corps Logo" width="329" height="
 128" data-name="image" />\n\n<strong>Ready to make an impact? Discover wha
