 trong> like!</strong>\n\nCurious about giving a year to service\, communi
 ty\, and justice? Want an honest\, insider look at the Jesuit Volunteer Co
 rps (JVC) experience?\n\n<strong>Meet 1-on-1 with <a href="https://jesuitv
 olunteers.org/team/">Caro Woodard</a>\, JVC Recruiter and 2-time former Je
 suit Volunteer!</strong>\n\nCaro graduated from the University of Georgia 
 before taking on two transformative years of service in Boise\, Idaho\, an
 d Portland\, Maine. Whether you're just exploring the idea or ready to div
 e in\, Caro is excited to chat with you about:\n<ul>\n 	<li>What a year of
  service actually looks like day-to-day</li>\n 	<li>Exciting placement opp
 ortunities across the country</li>\n 	<li>Real\, unfiltered answers to all
  your JVC questions</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>Don’t miss this chance to map o
 ut your next big adventure!</strong>\n\nView this event on the Carleton Co
 llege website:\nhttps://www.carleton.edu/_c/ut7T
