 ouncils strengthens international ties and mutual understanding through ex
 cellence in academic\, professional and cultural exchange\, language acqui
 sition\, educational development\, and research. We aim to empower individ
 uals and institutions to address challenges in a diverse and interconnecte
 d world.\n\nFor over 45 years\, American Councils has been a leader in inn
 ovative overseas study programs. Its knowledgeable staff\, reputable partn
 ers\, and expert host-university faculty provide the ideal opportunity for
  maximum academic achievement.\n\nEvent Details:\nhttps://www.studyabroad.
 americancouncils.org/\n\nView this event on the Carleton College website:\
