 href="https://carleton.joinhandshake.com/edu/events/1980370">Handshake</a>
DESCRIPTION:This focused workshop provides seniors and recent graduates wi
 th a clear\, step-by-step framework to navigate the graduate school applic
 ation process and craft a compelling narrative. Designed specifically <str
 ong>for applicants who are ready to apply</strong>\, you will learn how to
  articulate your core motivations\, pinpoint authentic themes for your per
 sonal statement\, and uncover stories that effectively answer common appli
 cation prompts.\n\nParticipants will engage in guided reflective exercises
  to complete early application drafts and determine appropriate timelines 
 for submitting their applications.\n\n<strong>Note: </strong>This workshop
  will not review types of degrees or how to explore programs. Students who
  do not plan to apply during the 26/27 application cycle are encouraged to
  attend the <i>Exploring Graduate School</i> workshop offered during the s
 pring semester OR schedule an appointment with a Career Coach.\n\nView thi
 s event on the Carleton College website:\nhttps://www.carleton.edu/_c/ut4t
ORGANIZER;CN="Career Center Events":mailto:e6n22m53s4lq205dsr03tqqlf4@grou
 p.calendar.google.com
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260814T181345
END:VEVENT
