 trategies for highlighting your strengths\, tips for professional communic
 ation.\n\nWhether you're preparing for internships\, part-time jobs\, or f
 ull-time roles\, this workshop will help you feel more prepared for your n
 ext interview.\n\nView this event on the Carleton College website:\nhttps:
 //www.carleton.edu/_c/ut3U
