SUMMARY:Caring for the Caregiver
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DESCRIPTION:Few people are prepared for the challenges of being a caregive
 r. This training reminds caregivers of the sense of satisfaction that come
 s with caregiving\, while also emphasizing the importance of caring for yo
 urself to prevent compassion fatigue and burnout. The presentation outline
 s strategies for self-care and reviews work life balance tips.\n\nThis web
 inar will be presented by Susan Ferraro\, PMHNP\, R.N.\, M.S.\, a Health A
 dvocate EAP-affiliated facilitator.\n\nStaff and faculty must <a href="htt
 ps://www.myworkday.com/carleton/learning/course/153a841b28d31000c1dc995c30
 b30000?type=9882927d138b100019b6a2df1a46018b">register for this webinar</a
 > through Workday. Upon enrolling\, the Zoom link will be available throug
 h Workday Learning and the calendar invite that you will receive from Work
 day.\n\nView this event on the Carleton College website:\nhttps://www.carl
 eton.edu/_c/ut9J
ORGANIZER;CN="Human Resources":mailto:b15mhdjetki0bmiaka260hdoh0@group.cal
 endar.google.com
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260811T145722
END:VEVENT
