DTSTART:20261021T100000
DTEND:20261021T120000
SUMMARY:Beyond Pronouns: Accompliceship and Critical Support for Trans\, N
 on-Binary\, and Gender Expansive+ Students
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
LOCATION:AGH 114
DESCRIPTION:<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span style="font-weight: 400">Thi
 s interactive session moves beyond foundational awareness to focus directl
 y on the actionable skills faculty and staff can implement daily. We will 
 ground our work in real\, anonymized campus data detailing the unique chal
 lenges that trans\, non-binary\, and gender expansive+ students face as th
 ey navigate an increasingly hostile national climate.</span>\n\n<span styl
 e="font-weight: 400">Through engaging with real-life scenarios tailored to
  various roles on campus\, participants will gain clear\, practical strate
 gies to ensure all students feel affirmed\, supported\, and included in </
 span><i><span style="font-weight: 400">every</span></i><span style="font-w
 eight: 400"> campus interaction—from the classroom and advising meetings
  to campus events and administrative support. The goal is to equip partici
 pants to move beyond simply being a supporter to becoming an active accomp
 lice in fostering a truly safe and equitable campus environment.</span>\n\
 nFacilitated by: <a href="jgonzales@carleton.edu">Jonathan Gonzales</a> (t
 hey/them/jogo) Director: Gender and Sexuality Center and <a href="kthwaits
 @carleton.edu">Kalena Thwaits</a> (she/her) Assistant Director: Gender and
  Sexuality Center\n\n<span style="font-weight: 400">This event is part of 
 IDE Community Education</span>\n\n<a href="https://www.myworkday.com/carle
 ton/learning/offering/98c4fd7f70581001b82dce71e8ee0001?type=7c48590b525710
 0009485b7a25ae0068"><span style="font-weight: 400">Register on Workday</sp
 an></a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\nView this event on the Carleton
  College website:\nhttps://www.carleton.edu/_c/ut8O
ORGANIZER;CN="Division of Inclusion, Equity, and Community":mailto:l60qmlb
 93d9qlrf78jk9i21bms@group.calendar.google.com
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260821T205536
END:VEVENT
