DESCRIPTION:Carleton will be offering early voting on campus\, as an addit
 ional convenient alternative to voting on election day or other early voti
 ng options. <span class="gmail_default">A</span>nyone eligible to vote in 
 Rice County<span class="gmail_default"> or the Northfield portion of Dakot
 a County</span> can vote at this event\, including employees and members o
 f the public<span class="gmail_default">. Only ballots for those wards and
  precincts will be available. </span>\n\nIn Minnesota\, voters can regist
 er to vote in advance or at the polls. To save time at the polls\, pre-reg
 ister via<a href="https://www.sos.mn.gov/elections-voting/register-to-vote
 /"> the Minnesota Secretary of State's Office online form</a> by October 1
 1 for early voting event at Carleton or by October 13 for the General Elec
 tion on November 3.\n\nStudents who are not already registered to vote can
  still vote at this event. Those living in campus housing can simply prese
 nt their OneCard to register at the time of voting.\n\nView this event on 
 the Carleton College website:\nhttps://www.carleton.edu/_c/ut8y
