SUMMARY:Northwestern Health Sciences University Tabling at Sayles
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
LOCATION:<a href="https://apps.carleton.edu/map/sayles/">Sayles-Hill Great
  Space Tables</a>
DESCRIPTION:<div><img class="" src="https://d31kydh6n6r5j5.cloudfront.net/
 uploads/sites/676/2022/01/Northwestern_Health_Sciences_University_logo.png
 " alt="Northwestern Health Sciences University" width="229" height="193" d
 ata-name="image" /></div>\n<a href="https://www.nwhealth.edu/" target="_bl
 ank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Northwestern Health Sciences University</a>
 \, located in Bloomington\, Minnesota\, was founded as a chiropractic scho
 ol in 1941 with 3 students and has grown to offer <a href="https://www.nw
 health.edu/academics/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">12 academ
 ic programs</a> with a student body of more than 1\,000 students. Northwe
 stern prepares the next generation of healthcare professionals to not only
  deliver but also advance healthcare.\n\nLearn a bit more about their prog
 rams:\n<ul>\n 	<li><a href="https://www.nwhealth.edu/academics/chiropracti
 c/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Chiropractic- Doctor of Chir
 opractic Degree</a></li>\n 	<li><a href="https://www.nwhealth.edu/academic
 s/undergraduate-health-sciences/post-bacc/" target="_blank" rel="noopener 
 noreferrer">Post Baccalaureate Pre-Health Program</a></li>\n 	<li><a href=
 "https://www.nwhealth.edu/academics/acupuncture-chinese-medicine/" target=
