SUMMARY:Critical AI Literacy Certificate:  Copyright and Intellectual Prop
 erty (elective)
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
LOCATION:Leighton 303
DESCRIPTION:The Critical AI Literacy Certificate for Employees offers one-
 hour session during the academic term.  Some of the sessions are required
  to earn the certificate\, others are elective sessions.  For a full list
  of this term's offerings and to register your interest\, please visit the
  <a href="https://www.carleton.edu/ai/support-resources/critical-ai-litera
 cy-certificate-for-employees/">website</a>.\n\nEvent Details:\nhttps://www
 .carleton.edu/ai/support-resources/critical-ai-literacy-certificate-for-em
