SUMMARY:Government &amp\; Nonprofit Career Fair
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
LOCATION:<a href="https://sua.umn.edu/coffman-memorial-union">University o
 f Minnesota\, Coffman Great Hall</a>\; register via <a href="https://app.j
 oinhandshake.com/career_fairs/97222a68-05a2-435d-8825-abeef7e3547f/student
 _preview?token=gmRWeR5DzeoNvpDVsPdQYUUUngZ2uwRq_0b6CMwe4OoyuIKpo-ZJ9g">Han
 dshake</a>
DESCRIPTION:<img class="" src="https://cdn.carleton.edu/uploads/sites/676/
 2022/02/GovernmentFairLogo.png" alt="GovernmentFairLogo" width="415" heigh
 t="104" data-name="image" />\n\nThe <strong>Government &amp\; Nonprofit C
 areer Fair</strong> allows candidates to pursue professional opportunitie
 s and internships at all levels of government and nonprofit agencies. The 
 average participation is about 100 organizations. The job fair is open onl
 y to students and alumni from participating colleges and universities\, in
 cluding Carleton College.\n\nUniversity of Minnesota\nCoffman Memorial Uni
 on Building\, Great Hall\, Ground Floor\n300 Washington Ave SE\, Minneapol
 is\, MN 55455\n<ul>\n 	<li><strong>Transportation provided with </strong>
 <a href="https://app.joinhandshake.com/career_fairs/97222a68-05a2-435d-882
 5-abeef7e3547f/student_preview?token=gmRWeR5DzeoNvpDVsPdQYUUUngZ2uwRq_0b6C
 Mwe4OoyuIKpo-ZJ9g"><strong>registration</strong></a><strong> by Wed.\, Oc
 t. 21.</strong>\n<ul>\n 	<li>A Carleton Career Center staff member will dr
 ive a college vehicle to the fair. We will depart from the front of Willis
  Hall at 10:00 a.m. and expect to arrive at the fair at 11:00 a.m. We will
  depart from the event at 1:00 p.m. and expect to return to campus around 
 2:00 p.m. This is flexible\, though\, based on students' needs. A confirma
 tion email will be sent before the event.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n 	<li><stron
 g>Lunch will <u>not</u> be provided.</strong></li>\n</ul>\nView the list
  of registered agencies via Handshake by visiting the event's <a href="ht
 tps://app.joinhandshake.com/career_fairs/97222a68-05a2-435d-8825-abeef7e35
 47f/student_preview?token=gmRWeR5DzeoNvpDVsPdQYUUUngZ2uwRq_0b6CMwe4OoyuIKp
 o-ZJ9g"><strong>Student Landing Page</strong></a>.\n<ol>\n 	<li>After visi
 ting the link above\, click on the "All Employers" tab (additional employe
 rs will be added).</li>\n 	<li>Filter and search for agencies by various c
 ategories such as Job Types\, Majors\, Industry\, etc.</li>\n</ol>\n<stron
 g>How to prepare to get the most out of the event:</strong>\n<ul>\n 	<li>R
 eview the participating employer information prior to the event and do som
 e initial research on each company before attending.</li>\n 	<li>Give some
  thought to the questions that you plan to ask the employers.</li>\n 	<li>
 Create and practice a <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Lb0Yz_5ZYz
 I&amp\;authuser=0">30-second elevator pitch</a> to introduce yourself to 
 the employers.</li>\n 	<li>Update your LinkedIn profile and résumé\, and
  bring copies of your résumé with you.</li>\n 	<li>Take notes and follow
  up with the employers on any questions afterward.</li>\n</ul>\n\nView thi
 s event on the Carleton College website:\nhttps://www.carleton.edu/_c/ut05
ORGANIZER;CN="Career Center Events":mailto:e6n22m53s4lq205dsr03tqqlf4@grou
 p.calendar.google.com
