TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
LOCATION:Laird 205
DESCRIPTION:<span class="a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-of
 f font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none">Taki
 ng London as both setting and object\, this program combines literary\, ur
 ban\, and environmental studies with structured field experiences and a de
 ep dive into theater to give students first-hand experience of one of the 
 world’s most vibrant multicultural cities. From its history as Roman out
 post and hub of the U.K.’s vast empire to its evolving post-colonial pre
 sent\, among the world’s great metropolises\, London offers itself as a 
 deeply layered text of human striving\, meaning-making\, and change.</span
 >\n\nEvent Details:\nhttps://www.carleton.edu/ocs/london\n\nView this even
 t on the Carleton College website:\nhttps://www.carleton.edu/_c/uuah
