 href="https://carleton.joinhandshake.com/edu/events/1980378">Handshake</a>
DESCRIPTION:Are you ready to raise your job search game? Join the Career C
 enter for a dynamic workshop on developing and deploying successful job se
 arch strategies.\n\nParticipants will learn how to identify possibilities\
 , leverage their professional network\, and utilize online resources to fi
 nd and apply for relevant job opportunities. We'll address issues of timin
 g and task management\, and share perspective on the job market. By the en
