 a respectful\, open conversation. From current events to historical concep
 ts\, we cover lots of ground. We meet on odd-week Tuesdays (1\,3\,5\,7\,9)
  at 8 p.m. in the Chapel Lounge to chat\, unwind\, and explore questions a
 bout religion\, science\, ethics\, or whatever is on your mind. All are we
 lcome!\n\nView this event on the Carleton College website:\nhttps://www.ca
 rleton.edu/_c/roOf
