SUMMARY:Collaborative Community Building: A Faculty-Staff Initiative at Ma
 calester
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
LOCATION:Weitz 236
DESCRIPTION:<p class="p1"><strong>COLLOBORATIVE COMMUNITY BUILDING: A FACU
 LTY-STAFF INITIATIVE AT MACALESTER</strong></p>\n<p class="p1">This sessio
 n highlights a successful "classroom community" project we launched at Mac
 alester College. Over 400 students across 35 courses participated. We'll s
 hare key findings and important insights from our faculty-institutional re
 search collaboration.</p>\n<p class="p1">*This event counts towards IDE Co
 mmunity Education.</p>\n<p class="p1">Devavani Chattergea\, Professor of E
 nvironmental Studies\nNancy Bostrom\, Director of Assessment\, Macalester 
 College\nBethany Miller\, Associate Provost &amp\; Chief Data Officer Maca
 lester College\nStudents are welcome to attend.</p>\n\nView this event on 
 the Carleton College website:\nhttps://www.carleton.edu/_c/uufK
ORGANIZER;CN="Learning And Teaching Center":mailto:u689j2optk1d1fdkffleeam
 5s4@group.calendar.google.com
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260911T170150
END:VEVENT
