SUMMARY:Election Results Processing Space
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
LOCATION:Skinner Memorial Chapel
DESCRIPTION:Elections can be times of intense emotions. Often\, we are anx
 ious beforehand\, and depending on the outcome\, may feel a deep sense of 
 relief\, joy\, despair\, or even fear. Join us the evening following elect
 ion day to come together to process whatever has happened or is happening:
  to share how you are feeling\, to listen to the reflections of others\, t
 o contemplate what comes next\, and be in community together. All are welc
 ome.\n\nView this event on the Carleton College website:\nhttps://www.carl
 eton.edu/_c/ut09
ORGANIZER;CN="Chaplain's Office":mailto:gc0r4cojm5g3aensafau0dppd8@group.c
 alendar.google.com
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260605T202149
END:VEVENT
