SUMMARY:Critical AI Literacy Certificate:  AI\, Sustainability\, Environme
 ntal concerns (elective)
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
LOCATION:Willis 204
DESCRIPTION:The Critical AI Literacy Certificate for Employees offers one-
 hour session during the academic term.  Some of the sessions are required
  to earn the certificate\, others are elective sessions.  For a full list
  of this term's offerings and to register your interest\, please visit the
