TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
LOCATION:Anderson Hall 121\; For more information or to register\, see <a 
 href="https://carleton.joinhandshake.com/edu/events/1980379">Handshake</a>
DESCRIPTION:In this session\, you will learn how to effectively tell your 
 research story and start writing your professional CV that can be used for
  future research opportunities and/or graduate school.\n\nIn this workshop
  you will learn how to analyze a CV’s effectiveness\, draft a Research E
 xperience entry to add to your CV\, and equip you with tools to use to eff
 ectively solicit strong letters of recommendation.\n\nView this event on t
 he Carleton College website:\nhttps://www.carleton.edu/_c/ut33
