SUMMARY:Diwali
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
LOCATION:Weitz Commons
DESCRIPTION:Diwali is the Hindu festival of lights with its variations als
 o celebrated in other Indian religions. It symbolizes the spiritual victor
 y of light over darkness\, good over evil\, and knowledge over ignorance.\
 n\nThis celebration at Carleton will include musical and dance performance
 s followed by a catered dinner.\n\nThis event is co-sponsored by MOSAIC.\n
