SUMMARY:Hard Questions
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
LOCATION:Chapel Lounge
DESCRIPTION:Come to chat about some of life’s difficult questions in an 
 informal setting! Each week\, we introduce a different topic to tackle in 
 a respectful\, open conversation. From current events to historical concep
 ts\, we cover lots of ground. We meet on odd-week Tuesdays (1\,3\,5\,7\,9)
  at 8 p.m. in the Chapel Lounge to chat\, unwind\, and explore questions a
 bout religion\, science\, ethics\, or whatever is on your mind. All are we
 lcome!\n\nView this event on the Carleton College website:\nhttps://www.ca
 rleton.edu/_c/roOg
ORGANIZER;CN="Chaplain's Office":mailto:gc0r4cojm5g3aensafau0dppd8@group.c
 alendar.google.com
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260909T153318
END:VEVENT
