SUMMARY:80th Anniversary Celebration of the Chaplaincy
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
LOCATION:Great Hall
DESCRIPTION:<p dir="ltr">Come celebrate the 80th anniversary of the Office
  of the Chaplain! Since the first chaplain was appointed in 1946\, the off
 ice has stewarded the religious\, spiritual\, and ethical life of the coll
 ege. We will explore the role the chapel has played at Carleton\, how it h
 as changed through the tenure of seven chaplains\, and celebrate its vibra
 nt present and future. A complementary catered dinner will be served follo
 wing the program. All are welcome!</p>\n<span style="font-weight: 400">Thi
 s event is part of IDE Community Education.</span>\n<p dir="ltr"><a href="
 https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScOAES6x_yhpBv-2jU3EvsR1F_OeSQzGz
 nOL9Ga5R0GS5nXqQ/viewform?usp=header" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-
 saferedirecturl="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://docs.google.com/form
 s/d/e/1FAIpQLScOAES6x_yhpBv-2jU3EvsR1F_OeSQzGznOL9Ga5R0GS5nXqQ/viewform?us
 p%3Dheader&amp\;source=gmail&amp\;ust=1788027309745000&amp\;usg=AOvVaw3Bd3
 RbOkk81UTh-ap-SQ4o">Registration </a></p>\n\nView this event on the Carlet
 on College website:\nhttps://www.carleton.edu/_c/ut99
ORGANIZER;CN="Division of Inclusion, Equity, and Community":mailto:l60qmlb
 93d9qlrf78jk9i21bms@group.calendar.google.com
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260828T181953
END:VEVENT
