SUMMARY:Strategies to Manage Stress and Uncertainty
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://click.sfmail.healthadvocate.com/?qs=ABB7InYiO
 jEsImQiOjQ5ODh9AAcAAAAABh0rFn5HAtBjRD33FS2w-Or7ZMI0FkTAEMp_cmXfB_YbJwGvcwo
 XIDxSeljFtvm8sgyEHR2v3lWWVL7aXkpKvAqpvYsBHQ">Register here</a> for this fr
 ee webinar offered through our Employee Assistance Program (EAP)\, Health 
 Advocate.\n\nLife can feel unpredictable\, and modern challenges make stre
 ss and uncertainty almost unavoidable. Making decisions can feel overwhelm
 ing\, especially when the future seems unclear. Learning ways to manage th
 ese feelings can help you feel more confident and calm in daily life. Join
  us for a webinar to learn practical techniques for reducing stress\, impr
 oving decision-making\, and building resilience in uncertain times.\n\nTop
 ics to be covered:\n<ul>\n 	<li>Why stress and uncertainty persist</li>\n 
 	<li>How daily pressures affect our stress levels</li>\n 	<li>Practical st
 rategies to manage stress</li>\n</ul>\nPresenter: Karen Beaudoin\, MSW\, E
 AP Program Manager &amp\; Senior Trainer\, Health Advocate\n\nEvent Detail
 s:\nhttps://click.sfmail.healthadvocate.com/?qs=ABB7InYiOjEsImQiOjQ5ODh9AA
