SUMMARY:Fellowship Information Session
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
LOCATION:Leighton 304
DESCRIPTION:Many fellowship opportunities are available to Carleton studen
 ts. Some fund research\, experiential learning\, or other special projects
 \, and are offered through Carleton's Office of Student Fellowships or oth
 er offices on campus. Some are competitive opportunities sponsored by outs
 ide organizations and open to students from other colleges and universitie
 s. Carleton's Director of Student Fellowships\, Marynel Ryan Van Zee\, wil
 l describe the various fellowships you can apply for (now or later)\, expl
 ain what it takes to be a competitive candidate\, and answer questions.\n\
 nView this event on the Carleton College website:\nhttps://www.carleton.ed
 u/_c/ut5j
