BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:popu4dkuutqhjv1jd5b96dv10s
SEQUENCE:0
DTSTAMP:20260924T045925
DTSTART:20270206T130000
DTEND:20270206T160000
SUMMARY:Carleton Impact Challenge Student Team Pitches and Reception
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
LOCATION:Weitz Center for Creativity\nRoom 161 Cinema
DESCRIPTION:<p style="text-align: center"><span style="color: #000080"><st
 rong>1:00-3:00pm - Student team pitches and judging </strong></span></p>\n
 <p style="text-align: center"><span style="color: #000080"><strong>3:00-3:
 30pm - Conversation with Alumni</strong></span></p>\n<p style="text-align:
  center"><span style="color: #000080"><strong> (Weitz Room 161 Cinema)\n</
 strong></span></p>\n<p style="text-align: center">While judges deliberate\
 , Prof. Nathan Grawe will lead a conversation with Carleton alumnus Cornel
 l Hills about his path from Carleton to entrepreneurial careers.</p>\n<p s
 tyle="text-align: center"><span style="color: #000080"><strong>3:30pm - Re
 ception and prize announcements</strong></span></p>\n<p class="text--intro
 " style="text-align: center"><strong>The 2027 Carleton Impact Challenge Pr
 ogram will be posted in late January</strong></p>\nTeams of students will 
 compete for prize money to support their entrepreneurial ventures.  A tea
 m of Carleton alumni judges will select winners based on a written proposa
 l and oral pitches.\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class="is-style-default">
 The first-place team will receive a $10\,000 team fellowship\, individual 
 Career Center experiential learning grants and MN Cup finalist bid. The se
 cond-place team will receive individual Career Center experiential learnin
 g grants.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class="is-
 style-default">We invite you to celebrate the great entrepreneurial spirit
  on campus by attending this event.</p>\nContact Nathan Grawe (<a href="ma
 ilto:ngrawe@carleton.edu">ngrawe@carleton.edu</a>)\, Lloyd P. Johnson-Norw
 est Professor of Economics and the Liberal Arts\, with any questions.\n\n&
 nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n
 \n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n<!-- /wp:paragrap
 h -->\n\nView this event on the Carleton College website:\nhttps://www.car
 leton.edu/_c/uud4
ORGANIZER;CN="Economics Department":mailto:3u4efrb60uq1jghq314i1b6p2k@grou
 p.calendar.google.com
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260911T214520
END:VEVENT
