SUMMARY:Dedication of the Arboretum Centennial Trail
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
LOCATION:Cowling Arboretum
DESCRIPTION:The Centennial Trail will run through the entire Arboreutm\, l
 inking the Upper Arb entrance at Second Street with the northern end of th
 e Arb at the Iron Bridge. The trail will be created by designating a route
  through the Arboretum that passes sites of historical interest and demons
 trates a wide variety of the work accomplished by the College and Arboretu
 m staff over its 100 year history. An audio tour of ten historic spots alo
 ng the route is under development. This is the establishment of a specific
  historical route utilizing existing trails.\n\nView this event on the Car
 leton College website:\nhttps://www.carleton.edu/_c/utPo
ORGANIZER;CN="Cowling Arboretum":mailto:arsa1npokgd6u28r3pibqv644s@group.c
 alendar.google.com
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260421T204515
END:VEVENT
