SUMMARY:SHAC Immunization Clinic
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
LOCATION:Class of 1974 Center
DESCRIPTION:Do you need a TDAP booster\, influenza\, COVID\, HPV\, or
  another vaccination?\n\nSHAC hosts a monthly immunization clinic administ
 ered by Homeland Health for students only.\n\nPlease pre-register at least
  a week before the scheduled dates by calling (507-222-4080)\, emailing sh
 ac@carleton.edu\, or stopping by the SHAC front desk in the Class of 1974 
 Center\, 2nd floor.\n\nSee <a href="https://www.carleton.edu/student-healt
 h/carleton-services/medical-services/immunizations/">here</a> for a list 
 of immunizations available.\n\nView this event on the Carleton College web
 site:\nhttps://www.carleton.edu/_c/utJG
