SUMMARY:Monthly Graph Clinic for staff
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
LOCATION:QRC\, 4th Libe\, East Wing
DESCRIPTION:Do you present data about your programs and wish your graphs w
 ere better? Do you wish you had graphs\, but you're not sure how to make t
 hem? Bring your graphs\, data\, or ideas to the QRC (4th Libe\, East Wing)
  on the first Tuesday of the month during common time (12:00 - 1:00 pm) to
  get feedback or brainstorm with Lin\, the QRC director.\n\nConnect to Vir
 tual Event:\nhttps://meet.google.com/kzv-bshb-aeg\n\nView this event on th
 e Carleton College website:\nhttps://www.carleton.edu/_c/rowe
