SEQUENCE:0
DTSTAMP:20260924T045925
DTSTART:20430917T160000
DTEND:20430917T170000
SUMMARY:Caring for Aging Parents for Staff and Faculty
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
LOCATION:Multicultural Center 019\n(June 18\, 2026 moved to Laird 007)
DESCRIPTION:<p class="cvGsUA direction-ltr align-start para-style-body"><s
 pan class="a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature
 -calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none">Navigating the com
 plexities of eldercare—from managing </span><span class="a_GcMg font-fea
 ture-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-
 none text-strikethrough-none">medical appointments and legal paperwork to 
 the emotional </span><span class="a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-featur
 e-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-n
 one">weight of changing family roles—is a journey few of us are prepared
  for. Whether you are currently providing daily care for an aging parent\,
  supporting an adult friend through a health crisis\, or simply beginning 
 to plan for the future\, you don't have to manage it in isolation. </span
 ></p>\n<p class="cvGsUA direction-ltr align-start para-style-body"><span c
 lass="a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt
 -off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none">We hope to provide a de
 dicated space where we can find both practical resources and authentic pee
 r support. By coming together\, we can share vetted local resources\, navi
 gate insurance and healthcare hurdles\, and offer a listening ear to those
  balancing professional excellence with personal sacrifice.</span></p>\n\n
 <ul>\n 	<li><span class="a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-of
 f font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none">Reso
 urce Sharing: </span><span class="a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-featur
 e-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-n
 one">Access to curated lists of local home-health services\, elder law spe
 cialists\, and respite care.</span></li>\n 	<li><span class="a_GcMg font-f
 eature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoratio
 n-none text-strikethrough-none">Regular Meet-ups: </span><span class="a_Gc
 Mg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-
 decoration-none text-strikethrough-none">Informal gatherings to discuss ch
 allenges and successes.</span></li>\n 	<li><span class="a_GcMg font-featur
 e-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-non
 e text-strikethrough-none">Expert Guest Speakers: </span><span class="a_Gc
 Mg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-
 decoration-none text-strikethrough-none">Occasional sessions with professi
 onals in gerontology\, financial planning\, and mental health.</span></li>
 \n</ul>\n<p class="cvGsUA direction-ltr align-start para-style-body"><span
  class="a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-ca
 lt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none">Taking care of those 
 who once took care of us is a profound responsibility\, but it can also be
  an exhausting one. We invite you to join us for our inaugural meeting to 
 help shape this group into a community that truly serves your needs. Toget
 her\, we can ensure that as we care for others\, we are also caring for ou
 rselves.</span></p>\n\nView this event on the Carleton College website:\nh
 ttps://www.carleton.edu/_c/rn8C
ORGANIZER;CN="Carleton Staff Events":mailto:lh1jd4felv7e6i55jm72gadrgo@gro
 up.calendar.google.com
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260604T143540
END:VEVENT
